              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td colspan="2" bgcolor="#000000" height="26"> 
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">
                    <tr> 
                      <td bgcolor="#000000" height="23"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><font color="#e1e1e1"><center><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/al.jpg" alt="Boom Kneegrow"></center></P><P>Well, paid another visit to Arch Lich Rhag`Zadune Tuesday night before patches, and lemme tell ya, was nice to actually kill him AND see loots without a mysteriously zone crash! (tks kronar not in zone!) Here's what dropped:<BR><center><BR><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/helmet.jpg"><BR><b>Grats Sicksee</b></P><P><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/arms.jpg"><BR><b>Grats Narilka</B></P><P><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/beast.jpg"><BR><B>Grats Mancub</B><BR></center><BR>Anyhow, kinda ironic that Mancub can't even equipt it yet, maybe now he'll try to xp harder then a level a month :(</P><P><center><BR><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/hp.jpg" alt="o______0"><BR></center><BR>High Priest of Ssraeshza was up after patch today, so paid him a visit, dropped easily before our zerg force of 39 people, loot was:<BR><center><BR><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/wrath.jpg"><BR><b>Grats Sindar</b></P><P><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/belt.jpg"><BR><b>Grats Katrine & Bonquisha</b><BR></center></P><P>Also got another kill on Xerkizh The Creator, sick of spamming the front page with dumbass pictures of his corpse over and over, so here's the loot we got.<BR><center><BR><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/ulak.jpg"><BR><b>Grats Snapgorth</b></P><P><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/earring.jpg"><BR><b>Grats Pasten</b></P><P><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/hammer.jpg"><BR><b>Grats Munas</b><BR></center></P><P><BR><center>On a related note..<BR><img src="http://www.vollkrass.net/grewrt/gleego.jpg"></P><P></center></font></font></td>
                    </tr>
