                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">
                    <tr> 
                      <td bgcolor="#000000" height="23"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><font color="#e1e1e1">To me, it's a good idea to always carry two sacks of something when you walk around. That way, if anybody says, "Hey, can you give me a hand?" you can say, "Sorry, got these sacks."</font></font></td>
